stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NotTriggered

    NotTriggered: NOT TRIGGERED
    Possible: POSSIBLE - upper bound at or above the line, lower bound below it
    Triggered: TRIGGERED - lower bound at or above the line and every guard passes
    Active: ACTIVE - tasks and filing instances scheduled
    Review: RETIREMENT REVIEW - raised, never an automatic retirement
    Retired: RETIRED - a named approver recorded the statutory exit basis

    NotTriggered --> Possible: O1 unconfirmed members or an unknown area record
    Possible --> Triggered: O2 membership resolved and the lower bound crosses
    Possible --> NotTriggered: O3 resolved below the line
    NotTriggered --> Triggered: O4 lower bound crosses the line
    Triggered --> Active: O5 effective date resolved
    Active --> Active: O6 count dips but the latch holds
    Active --> Review: O7 no latch holding, or O12 raised by the operator
    Review --> Retired: O8 approver records the exit basis and citation
    Review --> Active: O9 review rejected or the count re-crosses
    Retired --> Triggered: O10 count re-crosses
    NotTriggered --> Active: O11 voluntary coverage with a recorded basis

    note right of Active
        latch rule none - review once below the line
        look back 12m - holds while any day in the window qualified
        once covered and unconfirmed - never open a review by themselves
    end note
